canvas 520 280
label "Import and export: plain Markdown, OKF bundles, SKILL.md packs, JSON-LD and JSONL come into the Bundle (highlighted); Markdown or OKF, JSON-LD, JSONL and RDF, steer files, skill packs, llms.txt, chunks and Harnesses go out"
caption "The highlighted Bundle is the only store; every format on the left comes in without loss and every format on the right is derived from it."
